From: Firmware Maintainers <firmware@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] camera: detect capture stalls and bound runtime recovery

Track actual frame arrivals with steady time, supervise recovery through the
existing protected lifecycle, preserve manual recovery after exhaustion, and
show safe capture diagnostics in the web interface. Include regression tests.

Upstream-Status: Pending

